Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:52:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Start > Network: Wi-Fi scan / connect / status / SSH server
 (scripts in /boot run in a terminal window; the network is kept in
 /home/wifi.conf); Save log now includes ifconfig/iwconfig nds and the routes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
